The Apple Watch Series 12 and Apple Watch Ultra 4 feature a refreshed band lineup for the fall, adding new colors and materials.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/09/apple-watch-series-12-modern-buckle.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1063620" /><br/>
<br/>
Here's a breakdown of what's new across the band lineup:<br/>
<br/>
<ul><br/>
<li><strong>Sport Band</strong>: New Navy Blue, Magenta, Olive, Burgundy, Wildflower Blue, Pale Succulent, Sand, and Black colors for Apple Watch Series 12.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Sport Band (ceramic hardware)</strong>: Sand and Navy Blue to match the new ceramic Apple Watch Series 12 models; not available as a standalone purchase.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Sport Loop</strong>: New Olive, Burgundy, Limestone, Magenta, and Chambray Blue colors, plus a new inkjet-printed plaid pattern in Burgundy and Light Umber.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Nike Sport Band and Nike Sport Loop</strong>: Five new colors; Essential White, Chalk Calm, Pavement Grey, After Dark Black, and Green Spark.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Milanese Loop</strong>: New Radiant Gold and Natural colors to match the titanium case, plus a new Dark Bronze option, priced at &#36;99.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Link Bracelet</strong>: A new stainless steel bracelet in Radiant Gold and Natural, priced at &#36;349.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Modern Buckle</strong>: New woven material with flecks of color, in Mulberry, Camel, Sage, and Navy Blue, now available with gold hardware for the first time alongside natural hardware, priced at &#36;199 (42mm only).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Magnetic Link</strong>: Available in Wildflower Blue, Burgundy, Camel, and Midnight, priced at &#36;99.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Solo Loop</strong>: New Wildflower Blue, Burgundy, Olive, and Navy Blue colors, priced at &#36;49.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Braided Solo Loop</strong>: New Olive, Magenta, Wildflower Blue, Burgundy, Navy Blue, and Black colors, priced at &#36;99.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Trail Loop</strong>: New Dark Umber, Sand, and Burgundy colors for the Apple Watch Ultra 4, priced at &#36;99 (49mm only).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Alpine Loop</strong>: New Desert, Dark Olive, and Burgundy colors for the Ultra 4, priced at &#36;99 (49mm only).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Ocean Band</strong>: Now made from a translucent silicone material, offered in Translucent Gray, Translucent Kelp, and Translucent Black, priced at &#36;99 (49mm only).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Hermès Noir Satin Clou de Selle</strong>: A new band with a gold-finish clasp and saddle stud, exclusively paired with the new Hermès radiant gold titanium case, priced at &#36;499.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Hermès Rocabar Club</strong>: A new knitted H pattern band inspired by horse-jumping competitions, in four Bleu Nuit colorways paired with Gris Titane, Orange, Bleu Brighton, and Vert accents, priced at &#36;499.</li><br/>
<li><strong>Hermès En Mer</strong>: A new water-resistant knit band for the Apple Watch Ultra 4 with a pillowed stripe and titanium buckle, in Argile, Bordeaux, Bleu Nuit, and Orange colorways, priced at &#36;549 (49mm only).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Hermès Scub'H Diving</strong>: A new rubber band for the Ultra 4 with circular porthole-like cutouts, in Vert Vertigo, Gris Titane, and Bleu De Malte colorways, priced at &#36;549 (49mm only).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Hermès Grand H Titane</strong>: A new titanium version of the Grand H bracelet for the Apple Watch Ultra 4, priced at &#36;2,199 (49mm only).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Hermès Kilim Single Tour</strong>: Bleu De Malte, Cuivre, and Béton colorways, priced at &#36;499.</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
